# Membership Refund Workflow

## Objective

Handle refund requests using a structured approval and execution process.

## Flow

Refund Request Received

↓

Customer Verification

↓

Purchase Validation

↓

Eligibility Check

↓

Refund Processing

↓

CRM Update

↓

Slack Notification

↓

Customer Confirmation

## Design Principles

- Validation before execution
- System of record as source of truth
- Audit logging
- Operational visibility

## Benefits

- Reduced refund errors
- Improved compliance
- Better customer experience
